                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-27456\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: libblkid1\nVersion: 2.37.2-4ubuntu3.5\nFix Version: \nType: deb\nLocation: /var/lib/dpkg/status\nData Namespace: ubuntu:distro:ubuntu:22.04\nLink: [CVE-2026-27456](https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2026-27456)",
